A yellow cloud swirls around you, and as it clears you find yourself...

On the Steppe
The yellow cloud dissipates, leaving you standing in a boundless, wind-swept
steppe that rolls onward to the horizon. Strangest of all, you find yourself
encircled by four free-standing, ornate archways, each facing one of the
cardinal directions of the compass.

> e
Step by step, you pass beneath the eastern arch. A swirl of yellow mist envelops
you once more, and as it clears, the wide steppe vanishes...

The Country Road
You stand on a narrow dirt road winding between vast, rustling cornfields. To
the east, past the golden stalks, you can see the thatched rooftops of a small
village. A solitary oak tree casts its shadow over the wayside.

A ragged beggar leans against the trunk of the tree, holding out a weathered
hand.

